---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service" description="Happyranks terms of service.">
  <section class="section-y">
    <div class="container-wide max-w-3xl">
      <div class="eyebrow mb-4">Legal</div>
      <h1 class="text-display-2 text-white mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6 text-[#a0a0a0] leading-relaxed">
        <p><strong class="text-white">Last updated:</strong> July 2026</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-6">1. The PULSE audit</h2>
        <p>The free PULSE audit is provided as-is, for informational purposes. It is a directional measurement, not a guarantee of business outcomes. Use the findings to inform your decisions.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-6">2. Engagements</h2>
        <p>Paid engagements are governed by a separate Statement of Work (SOW) signed before work begins. Pricing published on this site is a starting point, not a quote.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-6">3. Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>You retain ownership of your data, brand, and content. We retain ownership of our frameworks, methodologies, and the PULSE audit scoring engine. Client deliverables (pages, funnels, etc.) transfer to you on full payment.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-6">4. Refunds</h2>
        <p>30-day money-back guarantee on monthly engagements. Cancel any time after the minimum term.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-6">5. Liability</h2>
        <p>We are not liable for indirect, consequential, or business-interruption damages. Our maximum liability is the fees paid in the prior 3 months.</p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white pt-6">6. Contact</h2>
        <p>Questions? Email <a href="mailto:hello@happyranks.com" class="text-[var(--color-brand)]">hello@happyranks.com</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
